{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01HA", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\begin{slogan}\nAn isomorphism of ringed spaces between locally ringed spaces is an\nisomorphism of locally ringed spaces.\n\\end{slogan}", "MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$Y$", "MATH_0003": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0004": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-isomorphism-locally-ringed}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ee92ccf47cf26a2759298c63a15c9b72a5253d244ac00fb50673b5f432263b20", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:aa0a647f32ea86f6dc859dc2cf6fe096f7c85ab93a58f68460250ffe472fedd9", "source_text": "<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002> be locally ringed spaces.\nIf <MATH_0003> is an isomorphism of\nringed spaces, then <MATH_0004> is an isomorphism\nof locally ringed spaces.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:03d6adf14cbc6a6b6fbf3e1a19b521d78638f920579e5d3345c7d5211cf5d173", "unit_id": "tag:01HC:statement"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01HA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$A$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$A \\to B$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f7b37e0a76afd4e3c8e0b80cbf4932274667dea894190712579dc45f6fcf2ce0", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3b8852445c139df8e994f8a2a9a831c1607e8c23b53c30ba81f3083e4ad15830", "source_text": "This follows trivially from the corresponding fact in algebra:\nSuppose <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002> are local rings. Any isomorphism of rings\n<MATH_0003> is a local ring isomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fcf47800fb7c75c281f6e9f82fb404804fac5eb5a399a60d5c3db0da51f7ea80", "unit_id": "tag:01HC:proof"}
